{"availability":"available","full":"sthamann/veyndo","name":"veyndo","description":"Commerce, rebuilt for the AI era. AI-native Rust core, connected business knowledge, agents, visual automation and a shared visual/coding-agent app platform. Self-hostable. Source available.","category":"Business","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-01T11:55:29Z","updated":"2026-10-16T15:42:31Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://www.veyndo.ai","topics":["agentic-commerce","ai-agents","ai-first","b2b","commerce","ecommerce","knowledge-graph","mcp","rust","self-hosted","source-available"],"demo":"https://sthamann.github.io/vendune/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T15:48:47.928Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T15:48:47.928Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T15:48:47.928Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T07:34:22.673Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T17:28:14.946Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-16T15:48:47.928Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Your storefront. Your apps. Your AI. One commerce core.","Start locally · See it in action · Interactive demos · Full feature tour · Build an app · How it works · Documentation","Vendune is a self-hosted Rust commerce system for B2C and B2B shops. Run a storefront, manage it in Vendune Studio, build custom experiences and give agents access to the same catalog, prices, inventory and checkout. AI retrieves shop knowledge and proposes changes; you review the exact changes before they go live."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sthamann/vendune/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e8d7b4a12c82d58f69bc9a760005a3a0822ea9a4696ff7c10a3faf29825772e2","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T06:39:26.043Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T07:34:22.845Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Your storefront. Your apps. Your AI. One commerce core.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sthamann/vendune/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Choose Create shop on the Studio login page to create your personal owner account and a separate shop.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sthamann/vendune/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Hosted clients need a reachable HTTPS endpoint and account-side registration; OAuth-based clients additionally need an appropriate gateway.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sthamann/vendune/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"A separate sign-in and registration leads to a responsive customer account: independent default billing/shipping addresses, cursor-paginated purchase history, immutable order details, current delivery and payment state, HTTPS tracking links, issued PDF documents and entitled digital downloads.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sthamann/vendune/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"e8d7b4a12c82d58f69bc9a760005a3a0822ea9a4696ff7c10a3faf29825772e2","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sthamann/vendune/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T07:34:22.845Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T07:24:29Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sthamann/vendune/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T07:34:22.846Z","hash":"e8d7b4a12c82d58f69bc9a760005a3a0822ea9a4696ff7c10a3faf29825772e2","originalBytes":21556,"storedBytes":21556,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T07:34:22.673Z","subjects":["Automation & workflows","MCP servers & agents","Self-hosted apps"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Business","subjects":["Automation & workflows","MCP servers & agents","Self-hosted apps"],"evidence":[{"subject":"Automation & workflows","source":"metadata","match":"automation"},{"subject":"MCP servers & agents","source":"metadata","match":"agents"},{"subject":"Self-hosted apps","source":"metadata","match":"self hosted